#. STRINGS.UI.TOOLS.UPGRADEPLANNER.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.TOOLS.UPGRADEPLANNER.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Pick buildings and the material to rebuild them in, or a type and what to replace it with, then box-drag: every matching building in the area is marked for replacement"
msgstr "选择建筑和用来重建它们的材料，或选择一种建筑类型以及要替换成的类型，然后框选：区域内所有符合条件的建筑都会被标记替换"

